# Range-test parameter changes (ArduCopter 4.7.1). Compare against your live values with Mission Planner > Config > Full Parameter Tree > Compare Params.
# Lines starting with # are comments. Values are the RECOMMENDED values; items marked (already) match your 2026-09 snapshot.
# --- speed (WP_SPD is m/s in 4.7.1; older docs call it WPNAV_SPEED in cm/s) ---
WP_SPD,10
WP_SPD_UP,2.5
WP_SPD_DN,2.5
WP_ACC,2.5
RTL_SPEED_MS,10
# --- return-to-launch ---
RTL_ALT_M,55
RTL_ALT_FINAL_M,0
RTL_LOIT_TIME,5000
RTL_CONE_SLOPE,3
# --- geofence: altitude ceiling + circle around home ---
